        <head>COSONATION FESTIVITIES</head>
        <p>THE COSONATION FESTIVITIES</p>
        <p>The Local Government 133ard forwarded order sanc- tioning any reasonable expenses with regard to the celc- bratbn of the Coronation ot hue Maj sty the Bing. The Clerk, in reply to questions, said that if Parish Councils had no balance they could levy a special rate and true overseers would have to coat ct it.</p>
