        <p>THE ESTIMATES. The Clerk laid boor. tn. mocil the Highway esti- mates for the yr ar 1902-1903. The total est,mat.ri ox- penaiiture was £3655 is 41 a 9 compared with £2646 che estimate for rI past year. The actual expenditure lamt velr was £2833 9j id. Of th. £3655 1s 41 the sum f £316 84 was sec, down for improvements and £3338 134 41 for repairs. The estim,tcs were referred to a committee for con- deration after an insp.^ction of the roads.</p>
